      "designNotes": [
        {
          "id": "note-1782159056579-9y52",
          "text": "Sensor models (1σ): star tracker 5″ as a small-angle rotation about a random axis, 15° FOV, sun-exclusion; gyro: ω̃=ω+b+n, ARW 0.1°/√hr (n~N(0,σ_ARW²/dt)), bias random walk 1°/hr; magnetometer: B_body=R(q)B_I+N(0,(50nT)²), normalized; sun sensor: ŝ_body=R(q)ŝ_I+N(0,(1°)²), 70° FOV, eclipse-gated.",
          "format": "markdown",
          "color": "amber",
          "x": 20,
          "y": -60,
          "createdAt": "2026-06-22T20:10:56.579Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-06-22T20:10:56.579Z"
        }
      ]
    },
