      "designNotes": [
        {
          "id": "note-1782159056701-531d",
          "text": "Mode logic: INIT→COARSE_ACQ when sensors healthy; COARSE_ACQ→FINE_TRACK when star-tracker locked and error<2°; ↔ECLIPSE on eclipse entry/exit; →SAFE on NEES>threshold or gyro failure (reachable within 2 cycles).",
          "format": "markdown",
          "color": "rose",
          "x": 20,
          "y": -60,
          "createdAt": "2026-06-22T20:10:56.701Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-06-22T20:10:56.701Z"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node-mqpnhjgf-f2oj",
      "title": "MEKF Estimator",
      "role": "component",
      "description": "6-state Multiplicative EKF (3 attitude error + 3 gyro bias). Gyro-driven predict; multiplicative star-tracker/vector updates; Joseph-form covariance.",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 80,
      "tags": [],
      "workspaceDirectory": "src/gnc/navigation",
      "aiModificationPolicy": "default",
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "p-mekf-meas",
          "name": "measurements",
          "kind": "data",
          "direction": "in",
          "dataType": "SensorMeasurements"
        },
        {
          "id": "p-mekf-ref",
          "name": "ref_inertial",
          "kind": "data",
          "direction": "in",
          "dataType": "ReferenceVectors"
        },
        {
          "id": "p-mekf-active",
          "name": "active_sensors",
          "kind": "data",
          "direction": "in",
          "dataType": "Set{Symbol}"
        },
        {
          "id": "p-mekf-est",
          "name": "estimate",
          "kind": "data",
          "direction": "out",
          "dataType": "AttitudeEstimate",
          "subPorts": [
            {
              "id": "p-mekf-est-q",
              "name": "q_est",
              "kind": "data",
              "direction": "bidirectional",
              "dataType": "Quaternion"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-mekf-est-w",
              "name": "omega_est",
              "kind": "data",
              "direction": "bidirectional",
              "dataType": "Vector3 rad/s"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-mekf-est-b",
              "name": "gyro_bias",
              "kind": "data",
              "direction": "bidirectional",
              "dataType": "Vector3 rad/s"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-mekf-est-P",
              "name": "covariance",
              "kind": "data",
              "direction": "bidirectional",
              "dataType": "Matrix6"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-mekf-est-n",
              "name": "nees",
              "kind": "data",
              "direction": "bidirectional",
              "dataType": "Float64"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "designNotes": [
        {
          "id": "note-1782159056337-hv06",
          "text": "MEKF — Multiplicative Extended Kalman Filter (6-state error: δθ∈ℝ³ attitude, δb∈ℝ³ gyro bias).\\n\\nPredict (gyro-driven): \\\\hat{\\\\omega}=\\\\omega_{meas}-\\\\hat b;\\\\; q_{k+1}=q_k\\\\otimes\\\\delta q(\\\\hat\\\\omega\\\\,dt).\\nF=\\\\begin{bmatrix} I-[\\\\hat\\\\omega]_\\\\times dt & -I\\\\,dt\\\\\\\\ 0 & I\\\\end{bmatrix},\\\\; P^-=FPF^\\\\top+Q.\\n\\nUpdate (multiplicative): innovation z, H; S=HP^-H^\\\\top+R; K=P^-H^\\\\top S^{-1}; δx=Kz;\\;q^+=q^-\\\\otimes\\\\delta q(δθ),\\\\; \\\\hat b^+=\\\\hat b^-+δb; Joseph: P^+=(I-KH)P^-(I-KH)^\\\\top+KRK^\\\\top.",
          "format": "latex",
          "color": "blue",
          "x": 20,
          "y": -60,
          "createdAt": "2026-06-22T20:10:56.337Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-06-22T20:10:56.337Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "note-1782159056461-7jps",
          "text": "Consistency: NEES = e^\\\\top P^{-1} e with e=2\\\\,\\\\mathrm{sgn}(\\\\delta q_w)\\\\,\\\\delta q_{1:3} vs truth; expected E[NEES]=3, χ²(3) 95% ∈ [0.35, 9.35].",
          "format": "latex",
          "color": "green",
          "x": 260,
          "y": -60,
          "createdAt": "2026-06-22T20:10:56.461Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-06-22T20:10:56.461Z"
        }
      ]
    },
