        {
          "id": "note-1782159056839-bzs5",
          "text": "Integration: implements calcNavigationEffect!(model,u,p,t,sat_idx). Reads truth from rigid_body_dynamics, references from ephemerides; runs SensorSuite→ModeManager→MEKF; writes NavigationEffectorOutput. Registers with navigation_guidance_callbacks at the configured rate.",
